#
# Fail-witness for the no-duplicate ban on AI (charter Hard Rule 10, ex:saNoRemintAiTerms): a
# fixture that RE-MINTS gmeow:ModelInvocation as rdfs:isDefinedBy the preference slice — the AC7
# no-duplication violation (Principle 16). Unioned with the module by the gmeow:saFailWitness
# teeth check, it makes the ∃-redeclared-term ASK HOLD, proving the mustNot ban has teeth. The
# module reuses ai terms by-reference only; it must never carry this triple.

@prefix gmeow: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/> .
@prefix rdfs:  <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .

gmeow:ModelInvocation rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/preference> .
